<title>UK: BP sets August LPG prices at $174/$158 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP sets August LPG prices at $174/$158 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum has announced its August  price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), the BP Agreed Price or BPAP.</p>
<p>Propane will be $174 a tonne, up by $10 a tonne from July, while butane  will be unchanged at $158 a tonne.</p>
<p>The price is effective from July 1.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
